    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6f58dc59-de5e-3e5a-8246-a015abb8e46c",
                "word": "CARB",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a97e5550-c475-3534-a899-5d9e84621052",
                        "entry_id": "6f58dc59-de5e-3e5a-8246-a015abb8e46c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Acronym of California Air Resources Board."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "acronym",
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8607904c-affe-4229-825c-f811e12429c0",
                                "sense_id": "a97e5550-c475-3534-a899-5d9e84621052",
                                "text": "In a press release, CARB expanded on their decision. \"The LCFS reduces air pollution and greenhouse gas emissions by setting a declining carbon intensity target for transportation fuels used in California; producers that don't meet established benchmarks buy credits from those that do. This system has generated $4 billion in annual private sector investment toward a cleaner transportation sector.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "d7fc68f5-3cc8-3e11-b838-90f40a19448d",
                "word": "carb",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "85f70717-8cbd-4d17-bc40-fb79f76a619c",
                        "entry_id": "d7fc68f5-3cc8-3e11-b838-90f40a19448d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "carbs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "778f0cb4-c922-3a7d-a8bb-c524135dc232",
                        "entry_id": "d7fc68f5-3cc8-3e11-b838-90f40a19448d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of carbohydrate"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "informal",
                            "plural-normally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2dfcb1a-43da-4b09-921a-cc190b707aec",
                                "sense_id": "778f0cb4-c922-3a7d-a8bb-c524135dc232",
                                "text": "I'm cutting down on carbs to try and lose weight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4f71dd6-a2ee-4d74-a647-d5118f755b2b",
                                "sense_id": "778f0cb4-c922-3a7d-a8bb-c524135dc232",
                                "text": "I'm looking into low-carb and no-carb options as part of my healthy eating plan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11ddf18c-17ca-4ce7-a2d2-65f89fbfafa2",
                                "sense_id": "778f0cb4-c922-3a7d-a8bb-c524135dc232",
                                "text": "But others say the new 'squaffles' and 'mushottos' are one step too far, and called for an end to the veggie carb trend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e08b5fe9-33f0-4cad-888d-847b9b17bf70",
                                "sense_id": "778f0cb4-c922-3a7d-a8bb-c524135dc232",
                                "text": "Supporters also claim that cloud bread is, essentially, a 'bread' without carbs. And it's gluten-free, so no wonder it's a big hit on social media, the birthplace of the paleo diet."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ae89306-50ca-3c19-abfc-90e1a02555a9",
                        "entry_id": "d7fc68f5-3cc8-3e11-b838-90f40a19448d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of carburetor or carburettor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3de3b467-218c-4cc8-a207-53722854d3af",
                                "sense_id": "5ae89306-50ca-3c19-abfc-90e1a02555a9",
                                "text": "This is what controls the flow of fuel into the carb."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9d62288-3f90-44ec-85b0-7539c6159f64",
                                "sense_id": "5ae89306-50ca-3c19-abfc-90e1a02555a9",
                                "text": "This engine came with dual four-barrel carbs straight from the factory. (The 1960s were a different time indeed.)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4613bc30-7b97-3a28-b63e-5bee92b347cf",
                        "entry_id": "d7fc68f5-3cc8-3e11-b838-90f40a19448d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The hole on a pipe which is covered and opened to control the inflow of air."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d0a7493-588e-4bc5-8867-bc9fd47133d1",
                                "sense_id": "4613bc30-7b97-3a28-b63e-5bee92b347cf",
                                "text": "She lifted her thumb off the carb and breathed in the thick smoke."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31a10e60-45ad-48fe-99d8-58645ccf1bfa",
                        "source_entry_id": "d7fc68f5-3cc8-3e11-b838-90f40a19448d",
                        "source_sense_description": "carbohydrate",
                        "target_lang_word": "glucide",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "glucide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65497cb9-3f8e-38d0-8582-51656a61cd2d",
                                        "entry_id": "3753f81f-35f7-3d44-9a3d-9e5ad87291c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Type de molécule composée de carbone, d’hydrogène et d’oxygène, un des constituants essentiels des êtres vivants, qui correspond aux molécules des sucres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Nutrition"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd347072-cf2f-432a-a21f-aabc28a0e121",
                                                "sense_id": "65497cb9-3f8e-38d0-8582-51656a61cd2d",
                                                "text": "Le jaune d’œuf contient des lipides, des protéines, des glucides, des minéraux, des vitamines et de l'eau. L'eau constitue 48 % de la masse totale du jaune. — (Reproduction des animaux d’élevage, Educagri, 2005, page 348)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba7cc6bf-2fe7-465a-8631-5bbf87d9412c",
                                                "sense_id": "65497cb9-3f8e-38d0-8582-51656a61cd2d",
                                                "text": "Les deux vagues de vieillissement observées ne portent pas sur les mêmes éléments. Celle constatée à 44 ans concerne des molécules liées aux maladies cardiovasculaires et à la capacité de métaboliser la caféine, l'alcool et les lipides. Quant à celle des 60 ans, elle est davantage liée à des molécules impliquées dans la régulation immunitaire, le métabolisme des glucides et la fonction rénale. Il faut ajouter à cela des molécules touchées lors des deux vagues: celles liées au vieillissement cutané et musculaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
